# Project

This is a NestJS 12 TypeScript API (`ai-assistant`), not a Nuxt/Vue app. Follow existing Nest modules, controllers, and services.

- Use ESM: import local files with a `.js` extension (`./app.service.js`).
- Prefer the smallest change that matches nearby files. Do not add wrappers, extra composables, or new architecture unless asked.
- Do not write tests unless the user asks. See `.cursor/rules/no-tests-unless-asked.mdc`.
- Keep types and call chains small. See `.cursor/rules/keep-it-simple.mdc`.
- Ollama HTTP lives only in `src/ollama/`. Other features inject `OllamaService`. Do not add Vue composables.
- Combining Gmail + Ollama happens only in `src/agent/`. Do not call both from a controller.
- Web search and page fetch live only in `src/web/`. Inject `WebService`. Do not call Tavily/Jina/Playwright from the agent file except through that service.
- Never put secrets, API keys, or `.env` values in source, rules, commits, or logs.
